# Jira Changelog Join Key

When joining `jira_issue_changelog` with `jira_issues` in this project, join via `issue_key`.

- Prefer `jira_issues.issue_key = jira_issue_changelog.issue_key`.
- Do not use `jira_issues.jira_id = jira_issue_changelog.issue_id` as the default join pattern in SQL, prompts, or generated guidance.

Examples:

```sql
-- BAD
FROM jira_issues i
JOIN jira_issue_changelog c
  ON c.issue_id = i.jira_id

-- GOOD
FROM jira_issues i
JOIN jira_issue_changelog c
  ON c.issue_key = i.issue_key
```
